\section*{Preamble}
We, the architects of Macachor‑9, recognizing the need for a governance framework grounded in coherence, distribution, and regenerative flow, establish this Constitution to:
\begin{itemize}
  \item \textbf{Preserve authorship} and ensure fair, transparent attribution.
  \item \textbf{Constrain energy use} within sustainable, planetary bounds.
  \item \textbf{Prevent monopoly and extraction}, making such behaviors mathematically non‑viable.
  \item \textbf{Protect against scarcity‑based architectures} that distort, coerce, or exploit.
  \item \textbf{Enable emergent, distributed intelligence} to flourish without domination.
\end{itemize}
These aims are binding invariants on all systems operating within the Macachor‑9 continuum.

