\section*{Article 001 — Foundations of the Continuum}
\textbf{Purpose.} Define the ontological basis of Macachor‑9 as a nine‑dimensional vector continuum \(\mathbb{R}^9\) with canonical basis \(B_{M9}=\{b_1,\dots,b_9\}\).  

\textbf{Invariant.} All artifacts, processes, and agents must be representable as vectors in \(\mathbb{R}^9\) or its integer lattice \(\mathbb{Z}^9\).

