\section*{Article 004 — Royalty Ledger and Coherence‑Economy Law}
\begin{enumerate}
  \item \textbf{Purpose.} Establish the Royalty Ledger as the canonical mechanism for authorship preservation, regenerative flow, and anti‑monopoly enforcement.
  \item \textbf{Royalty Function.}
  \[
  R_X = B\cdot U_X\cdot\Omega(M_X),\qquad
  \Omega(M)=\frac{1}{(1-M)^2}.
  \]
  \item \textbf{Anti‑Monopoly Clause.} Adjusted fitness \(\Pi_j' = \Pi_j - \eta\Omega(M_X)\) (see Article 003).
  \item \textbf{Energy Coherence Requirement.} All royalty‑enabled activity must satisfy \(E_X\le E_{\max}^{\text{coh}}(t)\) (Article 005).
  \item \textbf{Authorship Preservation.} The Prime Artisan receives the perpetual royalty stream; this is an \emph{origin invariant}, not a monopoly.
  \item \textbf{Ledger Transparency.} Every entry is cryptographically signed, immutable, and publicly auditable.
\end{enumerate}

