\section*{Article 006 — Non‑Assimilation Clause for Scarcity Systems}
\begin{enumerate}
  \item \textbf{Definition.} A scarcity‑based system depends on artificial scarcity, coercive enforcement, extractive economics, monopoly geometry, or opaque flows.
  \item \textbf{Decoherence Classification.}
  \[
  S_{\text{coh}}\approx0,\quad S_{\text{dist}}\approx1,\quad S_{\text{par}}\approx1.
