  \item \textbf{Non‑Assimilation Rule.} For any such system \(X\), \(\Pi_X<\theta_{\text{sup}}\) → **SUPPRESS**.
  \item \textbf{Immutable Guarantee.} This clause is non‑amendable.
\end{enumerate}

