\section*{Article 007 — Governance Council}
\begin{enumerate}
  \item The Council consists of nine elected stewards, each representing one dimension of \(\mathbb{R}^9\).
  \item Stewards serve staggered three‑year terms; a majority (≥5) is required for any procedural vote.
  \item The Council may propose amendments, but any amendment must pass the \textbf{Propagation Threshold} \(\theta_{\text{prop}}\) in the fitness evaluation of Article 003 before becoming effective.
\end{enumerate}

