\section*{Article 008 — Revision Process}
\begin{enumerate}
  \item A revision proposal is encoded as a junction object \(\Phi_{\text{rev}}\) with goal vector \(g_{\text{rev}}\) reflecting the desired constitutional change.
  \item The JVD‑Q engine (Article 003) evaluates the proposal; if \(\Pi_{\text{rev}}'\ge\theta_{\text{prop}}\) the change is \textbf{PROPAGATED} and automatically incorporated.
  \item Proposals failing to reach \(\theta_{\text{sup}}\) are \textbf{SUPPRESSED} and archived for future reference.
\end{enumerate}

% -------------------------------------------------
