\section*{Article 009 — Dispute Resolution}
\begin{enumerate}
  \item All disputes are submitted as junction objects with a dedicated \textit{resolution} goal vector.
  \item An independent arbitration panel (three members drawn randomly from the Council) runs a separate JVD‑Q evaluation; the panel’s decision is final.
  \item If the arbitration outcome yields \(\Pi_{\text{arb}}'<\theta_{\text{sup}}\), the disputed action is \textbf{SUPPRESSED} and rolled back.
\end{enumerate}

